As detailed in Alg.~\ref{alg:STRA}, the stratifier compares the number of active TTBs for each input feature against a stratification threshold to classify the feature to be either ``dense" or ``sparse". A feature index buffer is employed to track the indices of both sparse and dense features. Subsequently, the coordinated weights and input bundles are fed onto the dense/spare core for processing. 


