dataset. It includes recordings from 293 speakers (226 English and 67 Mandarin) over a span of 17 years, totaling 7,522 hours, with weekly samples. Our research investigates how aging affects voice features and the performance of advanced SR models, as well as the impact of age group and gender on speaker aging.

