However, there is an exception in case \#3 with $\epsilon=1\%$: the computational time of B3M1 is longer than that of the balanced box method. This discrepancy arises because B3M1 disregards the solution by comparing it with the upper-left or lower-right points, which should be recorded as solutions. As a result, the search area is expanded in this particular instance.


