\subsection{Parallelization, Performance and Computational Cost}
%Training overhead for QNN-based Poisson solver. Execution time for quantum simulation vs. classical solver? Scaling behavior and feasibility on real quantum hardware?

% Data Parallelism
%\begin{figure}
%    \centering
