    \begin{claim}{(Truncation preserves ratio)}\label{claim:truncate} 
    For $\ell_p$ metric, let $q'$ be a truncated point, where
    $q'^{(i)} = \trunc_{\{l^{(i)}, u^{(i)}\}}(q^{(i)})$. $l^{(i)}, u^{(i)}$ are defined in Line \ref{line:def-lu-1} and \ref{line:def-lu-2} of \cref{alg:alg-2points}.
