\section{Conclusions}
The 2025 CG:SHOP Challenge motivated a considerable number of teams to engage
in extensive optimization studies. The outcomes promise further insight into
the underlying, important optimization problem. This demonstrates the
importance of considering geometric optimization problems from a practical 
perspective.

