$d > r$ and
$d < r$.
To evaluate these scenarios, we used square matrices of various sizes, setting the matrix rank at $r = 0.4n$.
Sampling size parameters of $d = 0.4n$, $d = 0.6n$, and $d = 0.35n$ are tested.
