%\steffen{can we just delete ``promptly''? It does not seem to add information}
Each fragment is validated and refined through feedback from either human reviewers or an auxiliary \textit{Judge-LLM} \cite{gu2024surveyllmjudge} before it is integrated into the core ontology. By selectively retrieving only the most relevant schema and ontology context at each step, RIGOR limits unnecessary information, reducing hallucinations and ensuring the resulting ontology remains accurate and semantically aligned with the original database.
