\section{Methodology}

This section presents our novel approach called RIGOR (Retrieval Iterative Augmented  Generation of RDB-Ontologies), which operates on the relational-database schema (RDB-schema). 
RIGOR's complete workflow is illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig1}:
