RIGOR  builds the ontology by iteratively traversing the tables of the source RDB-Schema one by one, following foreign keys (\autoref{fig1}-(a)) and using a generative LLM (Gen-LLM).  
RIGOR extracts relevant context for every table (cf.\ Section~\ref{sec:dense-retrieval}) from
(i) the expanding core ontology 
