In both Phase 1 and 2, to enable comparisons with prior work, we use the same dataset as in \cite{pan2024lost}, i.e., a sample of size 1,000 from the CodeNet dataset~\cite{puricodenet}, which is a popular code translation benchmark %in terms of size and number of programming languages 
