  \caption{Examples of sampling trajectories from the initial pose to the pre-grasp pose. The gripper's trajectories are color-coded from dark red to yellow to represent the temporal evolution of actions. The blue point clouds represent the hand and object. The yellow gripper on the point cloud indicates the grasp pose.}
