The absolute value of the $N$-degree Fourier coefficient for $\propertyOddMajority$ is at least $\sqrt{\frac{2}{\pi N}}$ using \cref{thm:WhichPropertiesAreHardEvenForSmallerSets} gives us the required proof.
\end{proof}

