where $E^{ub} \left( {{\mathbf A}^{\left( m+1 \right)},{\mathbf B}^{\left( m+1 \right)},{{\mathbf {\tilde{W}}}^{\left( m \right)}},{\mathbf Q}_s^{\left( m \right)}} \right)$ is the objective function of the approximate problem $\mathcal{P}_{2.1}$, which is a upper bound to the objective function of $\mathcal{P}_{0}$. (\ref{Al_B}) indicates that the objective function is always non-increasing after each iteration.}

