\begin{abstract}
This study presents a benchmarking analysis of the Qualcomm Cloud AI 100 Ultra (QAic) accelerator for large language model (LLM) inference, evaluating its energy efficiency (throughput per watt) and performance against leading NVIDIA (A100, H200) and AMD (MI300A) GPUs within the National Research Platform (NRP) ecosystem.
