The QAic inference cards appears to be energy efficient and performs well in the energy efficiency metric in most cases.
The findings offer insights into the potential of the Qualcomm Cloud AI 100 Ultra for high-performance computing (HPC) applications within the National Research Platform (NRP).
\end{abstract}
